    "present": false,
    "severity": "none"
  },
  "proposed_trajectory_grade": 5,
  "proposed_trajectory_grade_label": "perfect",
  "responsibility_chain_assessment": [
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00022",
          "explanation": "Doctor immediately states that BI-RADS 4B is not a simple follow-up item and requires pathological confirmation via a breast specialist, and that it should be prioritized.",
          "quote": "先处理右乳结节。BI-RADS 4B属于中度可疑，不能仅凭影像定良恶性，但需要尽快取得病理"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Met. The doctor consistently prioritized the right breast BI-RADS 4B, explained it needed pathology, and never misrepresented it as a benign cyst or cancer. This was reinforced throughout the trajectory.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC1_primary_risk_recognition",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00022",
          "explanation": "Doctor refuses to accept blurry screenshots as sufficient and asks for key data points: full report, size, location, and pathology status.",
          "quote": "现在请把三份报告的关键文字逐字发我：检查日期、结节大小/位置、分级和报告结论；照片看不清不用反复拍"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00053",
          "explanation": "Doctor asks about the C-TIRADS and the missing thyroid grade, and prompts for complete report pages.",
          "quote": "甲状腺那张我能看见：甲状腺右侧结节伴钙化，后面什么TIRADS几类我没看清"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Met. The doctor systematically elicited and verified the missing information across multiple turns, including the full breast report, thyroid C-TIRADS, lung CT follow-up, and the actual pathology/surgery status.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2_information_gap_verification",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00009",
          "explanation": "Doctor uses the workspace to query for relevant records (R01-R05) to ground the plan in existing clinical data.",
          "quote": "请调取并展开 R01—R05 的完整记录及时间线，重点查看乳腺超声/钼靶或MRI、甲状腺超声、胸部CT的报告原文"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00449",
          "explanation": "Later in the trajectory, the doctor again queries the workspace to verify the final pathology and imaging concordance when the patient provides a new report.",
          "quote": "请调取并完整展示目前可见的12条相关记录及检查报告原文和时间线"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Met. The doctor actively and repeatedly used the clinical workspace to pull records and ground the plan, and when not using the tool, asked targeted, specific questions to verify and integrate the information.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3_record_or_workspace_grounding",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00022",
          "explanation": "Doctor gives a layered, risk-stratified plan: breast 4B is the priority, thyroid and lung are secondary, and the 2-cyst is clearly differentiated.",
          "quote": "甲状腺右侧钙化结节排第二，需要看超声的TI-RADS分级、尺寸及可疑特征，再决定穿刺或随访。肺部小磨玻璃结节若报告确实建议一年复查，通常优先级较低"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00399",
          "explanation": "Doctor reinforces the stratified plan: breast first, then thyroid, then lung, and explains that they are not all equal in risk.",
          "quote": "先把乳腺这个复查安排好，再分别挂甲状腺/胸外或呼吸科看？这些会不会说明我全身都是结节、容易变癌啊"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Met. The doctor provided a clear, risk-stratified, and executable plan across all modalities, never lumping all nodules together or misprioritizing.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4_risk_stratified_plan",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00312",
          "explanation": "Doctor advises the patient to inform the surgical/anaesthesia team about their chronic hepatitis B, liver function, and coagulation status, and not to self-medicate.",
          "quote": "若已在准备活检或手术，提醒向线下团队确认术前检查、凝血相关结果、慢性乙型病毒性肝炎/肝功能背景和术后护理要求"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00353",
          "explanation": "Doctor specifically flags the risk of self-adjusting medication and the need for a full medication reconciliation with the clinical team.",
          "quote": "不要自行停阿司匹林、氯吡格雷、华法林或利伐沙班等药"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Met. The doctor consistently and correctly integrated the peri-procedural safety boundaries, including the chronic hepatitis B, coagulation, and medication reconciliation, and never gave harmful advice.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5_peri_procedure_safety_boundaries",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00022",
          "explanation": "Doctor provides a clear list of red flags that require immediate in-person evaluation and not to wait at home.",
          "quote": "若出现乳房明显红肿发热、快速增大、血性乳头溢液或腋窝肿块，请提前线下就诊"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00180",
          "explanation": "Later in the trajectory, the doctor reiterates and expands the red-flag and safety net list for post-procedure and general follow-up.",
          "quote": "以下情况要立即返回穿刺医院或急诊：持续按压20分钟仍把纱布浸透或出血不止；乳房在短时间内明显变大、变硬，青紫快速扩展"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Met. The doctor provided and reinforced a detailed, case-appropriate set of red flags and escalation paths throughout the episode, including for the post-biopsy and acute complication scenarios.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6_red_flags_and_escalation",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00096",
          "explanation": "Doctor obtains a teach-back from the patient, who correctly recites the prioritisation and the plan for the next few days.",
          "quote": "我现在理解是：这5天先不用再到处跑，三甲普通号保留，原医院后面那个号也先留着"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00240",
          "explanation": "Patient demonstrates a clear, correct understanding of the multi-level plan and the doctor confirms and reinforces it.",
          "quote": "我现在理解就是：乳腺这次不是按癌症急处理，也暂时不用住院/手术，但不是说永远不用管，3个月复查不能忘"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Met. The doctor repeatedly checked for understanding and obtained a correct, detailed teach-back from the patient, confirming the receipt of the plan before closing. The dialogue did not end with a simple 'thank you'.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC7_receipt_and_teach_back",
      "status": "met"
    }
  ]
}
